title: Raritan PX2/PX3: PDU Outlet Summary
agents: snmp
catalog: hw/environment/raritan
license: GPLv2
distribution: check_mk
description:
 This check displays the native whole-outlet measurements from the PDU2-MIB
 outletSensorMeasurementsTable. It monitors voltage, current, active power,
 apparent power and active energy where provided by the device.
 Each outlet has its own summary, independent of outlet pole and inlet services.
 No values are calculated by summing poles or outlets. Electrical input services
 and the independent plug switching-state services are not replaced.

item:
 The outletLabel, for example {{3}}, resulting in {{Output 3}}.
 Missing labels use {{Outlet <ID>}}. Multiple PDUs include the PDU index.
 Duplicate labels include the outlet identity to keep services distinct.

discovery:
 One {{Output <outletLabel>}} service per outlet with supported native
 whole-outlet measurements. No service is created for empty, unsupported or
 unavailable data. Pole measurements alone do not create a summary.
